// A yes/no question asked once, in a window of its own: whether to encrypt the
// settings database (the first time a plain one meets a version that can), and
// whether a new portable copy should start from the ordinary profile already on
// the machine (see core::portable).
//
// Every caption is a translation key, looked up through `L` like the rest of
// the UI, so a language change redraws an open question too. The portable
// question is shown before any `Ui` exists, so its `L` is a fixed table the
// caller fills in - the body with the two folders already formatted into it.

import { ScrollView, Button, Palette } from "std-widgets.slint";
import { L, Dialog, Screen } from "globals.slint";

export component ConfirmDialog inherits Dialog {
    /// Translation keys: the window title, the heading above the question, the
    /// question itself, and the two buttons.
    in property <string> title-key;
    in property <string> heading;
    in property <string> body;
    in property <string> no-text;
    in property <string> yes-text;
    /// The window's width. Pinned - nothing here reflows horizontally.
    in property <length> fixed-width: 470px;

    title: L.s(L.revision, root.title-key);
    // Height follows the content, so the window opens exactly fitting whatever
    // the translation came out as, and only scrolls on a screen too short for
    // it.
    min-width: root.fixed-width;
    max-width: root.fixed-width;
    min-height: min(content.preferred-height, Screen.limit);
    max-height: min(content.preferred-height, Screen.limit);

    /// True for yes. Closing the window without choosing answers nothing.
    callback chosen(bool);

    ScrollView {
        vertical-scrollbar-policy: as-needed;
        content := VerticalLayout {
            padding: 18px;
            spacing: 14px;

            Text {
                text: L.s(L.revision, root.heading);
                font-size: 16px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: Palette.foreground;
                wrap: word-wrap;
            }

            Text {
                text: L.s(L.revision, root.body);
                wrap: word-wrap;
                vertical-stretch: 1;
                color: Palette.foreground;
            }

            HorizontalLayout {
                spacing: 8px;
                Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                Button {
                    text: L.s(L.revision, root.no-text);
                    clicked => { root.chosen(false); }
                }
                Button {
                    text: L.s(L.revision, root.yes-text);
                    primary: true;
                    clicked => { root.chosen(true); }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
